# CSS guidelines

Join class names with the `classnames` package. Do not use `clsx`, `tailwind-merge`, or a `cn()` helper from `@/lib/utils`.

`classnames` only default-exports the function. Use that import (this is the exception to named imports):

```tsx
import classNames from "classnames";

<div className={classNames("rounded-lg bg-card", className, isActive && "ring-2")} />
```

```tsx
// ❌
import { clsx } from "clsx";
import { twMerge } from "tailwind-merge";
import { cn } from "@/lib/utils";
className={cn("px-2", className)}

// ✅
import classNames from "classnames";
className={classNames("px-2", className)}
```

If `npx shadcn add` generates `cn` with clsx/tailwind-merge, replace those with `classNames` from `classnames`.
